export anchor ClaymorphismStyle:
    number: 37
    screen: TaskBoard
    name: Claymorphism
    idea: Everything is a puffy piece of soft candy clay, pressed out of a lilac surface with fat rounded corners, an inner highlight and a soft coloured drop shadow.
    base: light
    palette:
        lilacPage: #f3eefc, the page with soft pink and sky glows in two corners
        cloud: #fbf9ff, the top bar, the hero, fields, counts and points chips
        tray: #ebe3fb, the pressed-in column trays
        sky: #cfe6ff, Engineering cards
        peach: #ffdcc9, Design cards
        mint: #c9f2df, Done cards
        lemon: #fff1b8, the At risk pill with #6e4a00 text
        ink: #2b2340, text
        muted: #5e5675, field labels and the eyebrow
        grape: #6a3fd1, the primary button gradient and focus
        cherry: #b4233c, the Overdue pill text on #ffd9de and the dashed overdue ring
        forest: #1e6b45, the Done pill text on white
    type:
        ui-rounded, SF Pro Rounded, Nunito, Varela Round, Quicksand, Arial
        Rounded MT Bold, system-ui, sans-serif. The title is 40px weight
        900 with tight tracking, column titles 19px weight 900, card titles
        17px weight 800, body 15px weight 500, meta 13px weight 700, label
        chips 12px weight 800 uppercase and pills 14px weight 800.
    layout:
        A floating pill top bar with a glossy grape B ball, Brightwork, and
        Mara Okafor with a peach clay avatar ball. Then a big clay hero
        panel with a small Task board eyebrow, the title Mobile app 2.0 and
        the At risk pill, and the grape Add task button on the right. A row
        of pressed-in pill fields for Assignee, Label, Due and Search tasks.
        Four pressed-in trays each start with a round count bubble and the
        column name, then puffy candy cards coloured by label. Each card has
        a label chip and a points chip on top, the title, the due date with
        a calendar and an avatar ball with the name. Below 1080px two
        columns, below 640px one, with the hero stacking and the button full
        width.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 20px between cards, 28px between trays, 18px card padding, 24 to 40px between sections.
    density: Low. Big soft shapes with lots of air.
    corners: 36px trays, 32px panels, 28px cards, and fully round buttons, fields, chips, counts and avatars.
    borders: None on clay. Fields get a 1.5px #c9bdea ring so they read as wells.
    shadows:
        Raised clay has an outer shadow of 10px 12px 24px in grape at 18
        percent, a dark inner shadow bottom right at 8 percent and a white
        inner highlight top left. Trays and fields are pressed in, with only
        the inner shadows, reversed. The primary button has a deeper grape
        glow.
    icons:
        Chunky filled rounded glyphs at text size. Overdue is a filled
        triangle with the word Overdue in a cherry pill, and the card gets a
        3px dashed cherry ring. Done is a filled circle tick with the word
        Done. No due date is a circle with a dash. Avatars are glossy clay
        balls with initials.
    focus: A 4px grape outline at 55 percent offset 4px. A focused field gets a 3px grape ring and a soft 4px halo outside it.
    tone: Warm and plain sentence case, such as Find a task, Add task, 5 pt.
